            "notes": "## Items\n\nIn Round 2, you should get [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), unless it's one of the only items you can afford. Otherwise, get some cheap items that give Health. [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is an insanely strong item on [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a), as it gives [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and a crazy amount of survivability. [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) is very reliant on her cooldowns and she has so many of them.",
