            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 7, you should go for either [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) or [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) to synergize with [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0). [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) will make your ultimate even stronger, while [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) will activate [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) and heal Barrier Shield Health every time you use Shield Bash. [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae)  is another option, but I'm personally not the biggest fan of it.\n\n## Items\n\nAs for the last item, you should be able to afford either [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) or [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b), depending on which one you picked in Round 6. Otherwise, go for any cheaper item that gives Health. [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) pairs really well with [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b).",
